><div class="closing">20</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/property-holdings-incorporated/">phi</a></div><div class="closing">14</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="negative"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/republic-bank-guyana-limited/">rbl</a></div><div class="closing">539.9</div><div class="change"><span>-</span>0.1 (0.02%)</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/rupununi-development-company-limited/">rdl</a></div><div class="closing">500</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/sterling-products-limited/">spl</a></div><div class="closing">841.5</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="feature background group" style="background:url(https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/statistics-76197_1920-1600x1131.jpg) no-repeat center 50%; background-size:cover;"><div class="overlay"><div class="wrapper"><div class="content"><h1><div class="title">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited</div></h1></div></div></div></div> <main id="main" class="site-main wrapper group" role="main"><div class="sidebar col span-3"><div class="feed"><div class="bulletins"><h3>Bulletins</h3><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#26965" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $37.03 per share Second Interim Dividend 2026</a></div><div id="26965" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Second Interim Dividend of $37.03 per share to be paid on August 25, 2026.  The share register will be closed for the period August 18 &#8211; August 21, 2026,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 223"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/223/">Bulletin 223</a></span><span class="date">August 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#26686" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $16.27 per share First Interim Dividend 2026</a></div><div id="26686" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a First Interim Dividend of $16.27 per share to be paid on June 23, 2026.  The share register will be closed for the period June 16 &#8211; June 19 2026,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 221"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/221/">Bulletin 221</a></span><span class="date">June 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#26376" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Proposes a Final Dividend of $21.67 for 2025</a></div><div id="26376" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited proposes a Final Dividend of $21.67 per share for 2025, subject to approval at their 92nd Annual General Meeting to be held on April 24, 2026 at 2:00pm at the Marriott Hotel, Battery Road, Kingston, Georgetown. This will bring total dividend payments to $122.85 for the year 2025.</p></div><span class ="number 218"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/218/">Bulletin 218</a></span><span class="date">March 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#26244" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $35.41 per share Fourth Interim Dividend 2025</a></div><div id="26244" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. met and approved the payment of a Fourth Interim Dividend of $35.41 per share to be paid on March 23, 2026.  The share register will be closed for the period March 17-20, 2026, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 217"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/217/">Bulletin 217</a></span><span class="date">February 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#25670" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $29.46 per share Third Interim Dividend 2025</a></div><div id="25670" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Third Interim Dividend of $29.46 per share to be paid on November 24, 2025.  The share register will be closed for the period November 17-21, 2025,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 216"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/216/">Bulletin 216</a></span><span class="date">November 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#25326" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $29.73 per share Second Interim Dividend 2025</a></div><div id="25326" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Second Interim Dividend of $29.73 per share to be paid on August 25, 2025.  The share register will be closed for the period August 19 &#8211; August 22 2025,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 214"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/214/">Bulletin 214</a></span><span class="date">July 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#25168" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $6.58 per share First Interim Dividend 2025</a></div><div id="25168" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a First Interim Dividend of $6.58 per share to be paid on June 23, 2025.  The share register will be closed for the period June 16 &#8211; June 20 2025,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 213"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/213/">Bulletin 213</a></span><span class="date">June 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24653" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Proposes a Final Dividend of $19.83 for 2024</a></div><div id="24653" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited proposes a Final Dividend of $19.83 per share for 2024, subject to approval at their 91st Annual General Meeting to be held on April 25, 2025 at 2:00pm at the Marriott Hotel, Battery Road, Kingston, Georgetown. This will bring total dividend payments to $105.75 for the year 2024.</p></div><span class ="number 211"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/211/">Bulletin 211</a></span><span class="date">March 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24560" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $31.96 per share Fourth Interim Dividend 2024</a></div><div id="24560" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. met and approved the payment of a Fourth Interim Dividend of $31.96 per share to be paid on March 17, 2025.  The share register will be closed for the period March 11-14, 2025, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 210"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/210/">Bulletin 210</a></span><span class="date">February 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24052" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $23.17 per share Third Interim Dividend 2024</a></div><div id="24052" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p><span lang="EN-GB">The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Third</span> I<span lang="EN-GB">nterim Dividend </span>of <span lang="EN-GB">$23.17 per share to be paid on November 25, 2024. </span> <span lang="EN-GB">The share register will be closed for the period November 18-22, 2024,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the </span>Interim <span lang="EN-GB">Dividend.</span></p></div><span class ="number 209"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/209/">Bulletin 209</a></span><span class="date">November 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#23582" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $28.39 per share Second Interim Dividend 2024</a></div><div id="23582" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p><span lang="EN-GB">The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Second</span> I<span lang="EN-GB">nterim Dividend </span>of <span lang="EN-GB">$28.39 per share to be paid on August 26, 2024. </span> <span lang="EN-GB">The share register will be closed for the period August 20 &#8211; August 23 2024,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the </span>Interim <span lang="EN-GB">Dividend.</span></p></div><span class ="number 207"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/207/">Bulletin 207</a></span><span class="date">August 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#23254" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $2.40 per share First Interim Dividend 2024</a></div><div id="23254" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p><span lang="EN-GB">The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a First</span> I<span lang="EN-GB">nterim Dividend </span>of <span lang="EN-GB">$2.40 per share to be paid on June 24, 2024. </span> <span lang="EN-GB">The share register will be closed for the period June 17 &#8211; June 21 2024,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the </span>Interim <span lang="EN-GB">Dividend.</span></p></div><span class ="number 205"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/205/">Bulletin 205</a></span><span class="date">May 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24181" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $17.24 per share Final Dividend 2023</a></div><div id="24181" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved at their 90th Annual General Meeting held on April 26, 2024, the payment of a Final Dividend of $17.24 per share to be paid on May 22, 2024.  The share register will be closed for the period May 16-21, 2024, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Final Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 204"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/204/">Bulletin 204</a></span><span class="date">April 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#22978" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Proposes a Final Dividend of $17.24 for 2023</a></div><div id="22978" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited proposes a Final Dividend of $17.24 per share for 2023, subject to approval at their 90th Annual General Meeting to be held on April 26, 2024 at 2:00pm at the Marriott Hotel, Battery Road, Kingston, Georgetown. This will bring total dividend payments to $97.40 for the year 2023.</p></div><span class ="number 203"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/203/">Bulletin 203</a></span><span class="date">March 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#22869" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $27.98 per share Fourth Interim Dividend 2023</a></div><div id="22869" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. met on February 27, 2024 and approved the payment of a Fourth Interim Dividend of $27.98 per share to be paid on March 18, 2024.  The share register will be closed for the period March 12-15, 2024, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 202"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/202/">Bulletin 202</a></span><span class="date">February 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#22239" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $21.28 per share Third Interim Dividend 2023</a></div><div id="22239" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Third Interim Dividend of $21.28 per share to be paid on November 20, 2023.  The share register will be closed for the period November 14-17 2023,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 200"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/200/">Bulletin 200</a></span><span class="date">November 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#21773" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $27.15 per share Second Interim Dividend 2023 (AMENDED)</a></div><div id="21773" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of an AMENDED Second Interim Dividend of $27.15 per share to be paid on August 21, 2023.  The share register will be closed for the period August 15 &#8211; August 18 2023,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 198"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/198/">Bulletin 198</a></span><span class="date">August 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#21710" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $20.16 per share Second Interim Dividend 2023</a></div><div id="21710" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Second Interim Dividend of $20.16 per share to be paid on August 21, 2023.  The share register will be closed for the period August 15 &#8211; August 18 2023,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 198"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/198/">Bulletin 198</a></span><span class="date">August 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#21313" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $3.75 per share First Interim Dividend 2023</a></div><div id="21313" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a First Interim Dividend of $3.75 per share to be paid on June 19, 2023.  The share register will be closed for the period June 13 &#8211; June 16 2023,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 196"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/196/">Bulletin 196</a></span><span class="date">June 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#21112" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $12.83 per share Final Dividend 2022</a></div><div id="21112" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved at their 89th Annual General Meeting held on April 21, 2023, the payment of a Final Dividend of $12.83 per share to be paid on May 22, 2023.  The share register will be closed for the period May 16-19, 2023, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Final Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 194"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/194/">Bulletin 194</a></span><span class="date">April 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#20857" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $21.05 per share Fourth Interim Dividend 2022</a></div><div id="20857" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. met on February 24, 2023 and approved the payment of a Fourth Interim Dividend of $21.05 per share to be paid on March 20, 2023.  The share register will be closed for the period March 14-17, 2023, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 192"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/192/">Bulletin 192</a></span><span class="date">February 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#20230" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $18.33 per share third Interim Dividend 2022</a></div><div id="20230" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Third Interim Dividend of $18.33 per share to be paid on November 21, 2022.  The share register will be closed for the period November 15 &#8211; November 18, 2022,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 189"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/189/">Bulletin 189</a></span><span class="date">October 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19778" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $20.90 per share Second Interim Dividend 2022</a></div><div id="19778" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Second Interim Dividend of $20.90 per share to be paid on August 22, 2022.  The share register will be closed for the period August 16 &#8211; August 19 2022,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 187"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/187/">Bulletin 187</a></span><span class="date">August 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19532" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $15.64 per share First Interim Dividend 2022</a></div><div id="19532" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a First Interim Dividend of $15.64 per share to be paid on June 13, 2022.  The share register will be closed for the period June 07 &#8211; June 10 2022,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 186"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/186/">Bulletin 186</a></span><span class="date">May 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19501" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Resignation and Appointment of Director effective April 28, 2022</a></div><div id="19501" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Mr. Troy Beharry is appointed Director of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited effective April 28, 2022, while Mr. Chandradat Chintamani has resigned as a Director effective April 28, 2022.</p></div><span class ="number 186"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/186/">Bulletin 186</a></span><span class="date">May 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19216" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Proposes a Final Dividend of $9.94 for 2021</a></div><div id="19216" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited proposes a Final Dividend of $9.94 per share for 2021, subject to approval at their 88th Annual General Meeting to be held on April 28, 2022 at 2:00pm at the Pegasus Hotel, Seawall Road, Kingston, Georgetown. This will bring total dividend payments to $86.59 for the year 2021.</p></div><span class ="number 184"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/184/">Bulletin 184</a></span><span class="date">March 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19214" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="19214" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The 88th Annual General Meeting of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited will be held by &#8220;way of a virtual format&#8221;.  Demerara Tobacco Company Limited&#8217;s application to conduct a virtual meeting was approved by the High Court of the Supreme Court of Judicature on March 22, 2022.</p></div><span class ="number 184"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/184/">Bulletin 184</a></span><span class="date">March 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19058" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $17.30 per share Fourth Interim Dividend 2021</a></div><div id="19058" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. met on March 1, 2022 and approved the payment of a Fourth Interim Dividend of $17.30 per share to be paid on March 21, 2022.  The share register will be closed for the period March 15-17, 2022, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 184"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/184/">Bulletin 184</a></span><span class="date">March 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#18425" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Appointment of Director</a></div><div id="18425" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Mr. Andre Pryce is appointed  as a Director of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited effective  October 12, 2021.</p></div><span class ="number 181"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/181/">Bulletin 181</a></span><span class="date">November 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#18272" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $23.25 per share third Interim Dividend 2021</a></div><div id="18272" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Third Interim Dividend of $23.25 per share to be paid on November 19, 2021.  The share register will be closed for the period November 16 &#8211; November 18 2021,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 181"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/181/">Bulletin 181</a></span><span class="date">November 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#17794" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $22.60 per share Second Interim Dividend 2021</a></div><div id="17794" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a Second Interim Dividend of $22.60 per share to be paid on August 20, 2021.  The share register will be closed for the period August 17 &#8211; August 19 2021,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 178"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/178/">Bulletin 178</a></span><span class="date">August 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#17481" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $13.50 per share First Interim Dividend 2021</a></div><div id="17481" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. approved the payment of a First Interim Dividend of $13.50 per share to be paid on June 18, 2021.  The share register will be closed for the period June 15 &#8211; June 17 2021,  both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 176"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/176/">Bulletin 176</a></span><span class="date">June 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#17357" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Final Dividend of $9.85 for 2020 approved</a></div><div id="17357" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The resolution was approved for the payment of a Final Dividend of $9.85 per share for 2020 at Demerara Tobacco Company Limited&#8217;s 87th Annual General Meeting which will be payable on Tuesday, May 18, 2021. The share register will be closed for the period May 12-17, 2021, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Final Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 175"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/175/">Bulletin 175</a></span><span class="date">May 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#17289" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Proposes a Final Dividend of $9.85 for 2020</a></div><div id="17289" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited proposes a Final Dividend of $9.85 per share for 2020, subject to approval at their 87th Annual General Meeting to be held on May 7, 2021 at 2:00pm at the Pegasus Hotel, Seawall Road, Kingston, Georgetown.</p><p>The Company wishes to notify its Shareholders that in compliance with the COVID-19 restrictions with regard to public gatherings imposed under the Public Health Ordinance and pursuant to an Order of the Court, the Company will be providing the opportunity to Shareholders to attend the AGM remotely via a live webcast.</p></div><span class ="number 174"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/174/">Bulletin 174</a></span><span class="date">April 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#17135" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $16.60 per share Fourth Interim Dividend 2021</a></div><div id="17135" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. met on February 26, 2021 and approved the payment of a Fourth Interim Dividend of $16.60 per share to be paid on March 26, 2021.  The share register will be closed for the period March 23-25, 2021, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 173"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/173/">Bulletin 173</a></span><span class="date">March 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#17134" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $18.20 per share Third Interim Dividend 2021</a></div><div id="17134" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. met on December 21, 2020 and approved the payment of a Third Interim Dividend of $18.20 per share to be paid on December 31, 2020.  The share register will be closed for the period December 22-31, 2020 both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 173"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/173/">Bulletin 173</a></span><span class="date">March 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#16666" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="16666" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The 86th Annual General Meeting of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited will be held on December 21, 2020 at 2:00p.m. by &#8220;way of a virtual or hybrid format&#8221;.</p></div><span class ="number 171"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/171/">Bulletin 171</a></span><span class="date">November 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#16132" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $20.90 per share Second Interim Dividend 2020</a></div><div id="16132" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. met on July 24, 2020 and approved the payment of a Second Interim Dividend of $20.90 per share to be paid on October 2, 2020.  The share register will be closed for the period September 29 &#8211; October 2, 2020, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 169"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/169/">Bulletin 169</a></span><span class="date">September 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#16130" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="16130" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Approval was granted by the Ministry of Legal Affairs for the extension until March 31, 2021 to host the 86th Annual General Meeting of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited.</p></div><span class ="number 169"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/169/">Bulletin 169</a></span><span class="date">September 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#15787" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="15787" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited has tentatively scheduled its 86th Annual General Meeting for Tuesday, July 14th, 2020.</p></div><span class ="number 165"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/165/">Bulletin 165</a></span><span class="date">April 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#15784" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays Fourth Interim Dividend of $13.00 for 2019</a></div><div id="15784" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited met on February 19, 2020 and approved the payment of a Fourth Interim Dividend of $13.00 per share for 2019 payable on April 24, 2020.  The Register of Members will be closed from April 21-24, 2020 both days inclusive.</p></div><span class ="number 165"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/165/">Bulletin 165</a></span><span class="date">April 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#14242" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $13.00 per share Third Interim Dividend 2019 and a Special Dividend of $3.00 per share</a></div><div id="14242" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ></div><span class ="number 162"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/162/">Bulletin 162</a></span><span class="date">November 2019</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#13145" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; Appointed Ms. Patricia Bacchus as Director</a></div><div id="13145" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Limited appointed Ms. Patricia Bacchus as Director with effect from September 16, 2019.</p></div><span class ="number 161"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/161/">Bulletin 161</a></span><span class="date">October 2019</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#13151" class="inline-popup">Demerara Tobacco Company Limited (DTC) &#8211; pays $19.00 per share Second Interim Dividend 2019</a></div><div id="13151" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Tobacco Company Ltd. met on August 2, 2019 and approved the payment of a Second Interim Dividend of $19.00 per share to be paid on August 16, 2019.  The share register will be closed for the period August 13 &#8211; August 16, 2019, both days inclusive, to facilitate the payment of the Interim Dividend.</p></div><span class ="number 159"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/159/">Bulletin 159</a></span><span class="date">August 2019</span></div></div></div></div></div><div id="primary" class="content-area col span-9"><h2> Financials</h2><div class="carousel financials financial-nav"><div class="slide" id="2026">2026</div><div class="slide" id="2025">2025</div><div class="slide" id="2024">2024</div><div class="slide" id="2023">2023</div><div class="slide" id="2022">2022</div><div class="slide" id="2021">2021</div><div class="slide" id="2020">2020</div><div class="slide" id="2019">2019</div><div class="slide" id="2018">2018</div></div><div clas